>> The next step is learning which monsters are useful to eat and which you
>> never do. There are some that you only want to eat *much* later on. 
>
> What do you mean by eating much later on?

Later on with corpses means food poisoning most of the time but not for
a small number of types.  Much later on means when exploring deeper
levels.  *Much* later on means when exploring a lot of levels deeper. 
In NetHack nearly everything has uses that take a while to think of and
corpses are no exception to that rule.  They tend to lead on learning
that rule when you eat one and get a different message.


